   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n <title>Kaua'i Halloween Events 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n <header>\n <h1>FABOOLOUS FUN</h1>\n <p class=\"sub-header\">KAUA'I HALLOWEEN EVENTS</p>\n </header>\n <main class=\"events-grid\">\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">HARVEST FESTIVAL</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-03T10:00\">Sat., Oct. 3, 10am-3pm</time>\n <p itemprop=\"location\">Hanapēpē Athletic Field<br>Free admission<br>Free pumpkins<br>Food, entertainment, rides<br>educational tent and more!</p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">HALLOWEEN MOVIE NIGHT</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-17T18:00\">Sat., Oct. 17, 6pm</time>\n <p itemprop=\"location\">Kukui Grove</p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">26th KAUA'I CHRISTIAN ACADEMY FALL FESTIVAL</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-23T16:00\">Fri., Oct. 23 &amp; Sat., Oct. 24, 4-8:30pm</time>\n <p itemprop=\"location\">Kaua'i Christian Academy<br>Family FUN in a carnival atmosphere<br>Kilauea<br><a href=\"https://www.kcaschool.org\">www.kcaschool.org</a></p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">VILLAIN NIGHT</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-23T18:30\">Fri., Oct. 23 &amp; 30, 6:30-7:30pm</time>\n <p>Free performance and pictures with your favorite villain!<br><span itemprop=\"location\">Kukui Grove</span></p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">CANDYLANE &amp; GLOW SHOW</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T18:00\">Fri., Oct. 30, 6-9pm</time>\n <p>Glow-in-the dark puppet show, keiki carnival<br><span itemprop=\"location\">King's Līhu'e FREE</span><br><a href=\"https://Kingskauai.com\">Kingskauai.com</a></p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">ANNUAL SMMH KEIKI HALLOWEEN PARADE</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T09:30\">Fri., Oct. 30, 9:30-11:30am</time>\n <p itemprop=\"location\">Kapa'a</p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">KVMH BABY HALLOWEEN PARADE</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T11:30\">Fri., Oct. 30, 11:30am to 1pm</time>\n <p>Front entry to KVMH Medical Office Building Waimea<br>Keiki 4 years of age and under</p>\n </article>\n <article itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h2 itemprop=\"name\">WILCOX HALLOWEEN KEIKI PARADE</h2>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T12:00\">Fri., Oct. 30, 12-1pm</time>\n <p>Wilcox Medical Center Lobby<br>Keiki Parade, costume contest and trick-or-treating.<br>Keiki 4 years of age and under. Refreshments will be served.<br><a href=\"https://Wilcoxhealth.org\">Wilcoxhealth.org</a></p>\n </article>\n </main>\n</body></html>"
